  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></p><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\" id=\"isPasted\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\">Nautilus Wooden Jigsaw Puzzles are creatively designed by a team of artists and jigsaw puzzle enthusiasts in California.</span></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\"></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\">The unique cuts in every puzzle reflect the imagination and mischievousness of our different designers who throw in funky whimsical shapes, tricks and teasers to make each puzzle a challenging and entertaining experience.</span></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\"></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\">Our figural “whimsy” pieces are inspired by the wooden puzzles cut by hand in Victorian times reflecting not just the subject of the image, but also capturing the mood and style of the artwork.</span></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\"></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\">Nautilus Puzzles, cut using the latest laser technology, are fabricated from premium quality woods and inks, guaranteeing a durable heirloom product that is designed to be shared over generations.</span></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\"></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; font-weight: 700;\">Be advised: These puzzles may be habit-forming!</strong></span></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\"></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; font-style: italic;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; font-weight: 700;\">WARNING:<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></em></div><div style=\"font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; text-align: left;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; font-style: italic;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; font-weight: 700;\">These are puzzles for ages 13 &amp; up containing small pieces which may be a choking hazard for children under 3 years.</strong></em></div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>What makes us different:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">The puzzles are made from sustainably harvested wood sourced from FSC-certified forests, using archival paper and inks to create a high-quality, premium, heirloom product. The wood used is 5-ply rather than the typical 3-ply wood used in the USA. This allows us to create more intricate shapes, and the 4mm thickness, creates a lovely tacticle feel in the hand, rather than being a chunky feeling kids toy.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">The puzzles are beautifully packaged in our signature black and gold boxes. The larger puzzles come with interior silk cloth bags and a bonus poster.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">Earn 10% commision on all sales. 30 day cookie and high repeat purchase. Many customers buy multiple times within the first month.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><br><strong>How to promote us:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\" id=\"isPasted\">Simply promote the products using your affiliate link in blog posts or articles. Or feature the puzzles on TikTok, Facebook, Instagram, YouTube or any other social media.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\"><strong><br>Other information:</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size: 14px;font-weight: normal;\">We do not allow paid search bidding on our brand related keywords, but othern that feel feel to promote the products using related keywords, video, or display traffic.</p></div></div>",
